        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "「乙肝清」",
              "en": "“Hep BQ capsules”"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "屬全草本配方，絕無西藥成份和副作用。一般服用四至六個月便可大大減低病毒量或完全解決乙肝的問題。由康草堂科研團隊依據傳統中醫理論，結合現代萃取技術精製而成，專注於乙型肝炎患者的輔助調理及肝臟保護。",
              "en": "are a wholly herbal formula, entirely free of Western drug ingredients and their side effects. Taken for four to six months they can greatly reduce viral load or resolve hepatitis B completely. They are refined by Wonder Herb's research team on the basis of traditional Chinese medicine theory combined with modern extraction technology, focusing on supportive care and liver protection for hepatitis B patients."
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text-block",
