        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "乙肝清結合多種護肝草本精華，包括丹參、雲芝提取物、五味子等。根據現代藥理研究，這些成分具有抗病毒、抗炎及修復肝細胞的作用。配合康草堂高標準提取工藝，確保每批產品均達到穩定活性成分含量。",
              "en": "Hep BQ capsules combines multiple liver-protecting herbal essences, including Salvia miltiorrhiza, Yunzhi extract, Schisandra chinensis, etc. Modern pharmacological studies indicate these ingredients possess antiviral, anti-inflammatory, and hepatocyte-repairing properties. With Wonder Herb's high-standard extraction process, each batch maintains stable active ingredient levels."
            }
          }
